+config MEMORIA_BENCH_SERIAL
+    bool "Memoria bench build: screenshot, status and PCM journal over the USB console"
+    depends on BOARD_TYPE_MEMORIA_ESP_VOCAT
+    default n
+    help
+        Answer bench-only lines on the USB-Serial-JTAG console: `snap` (a screenshot as SNAP log lines),
+        `status` (one line of render and device state), `pcmarm` and `pcmdump` (record a fixed window of
+        playback, AFE input and AFE output into PSRAM, then stream it as PCMD lines). Test rigs only: the
+        image carries a marker the firmware publisher refuses, and flash.sh will not flash it without
+        --bench. Never enable it for a product image.
+
 endmenu
